# RAD — Webflow & Headless Shop Context

This repo (`rad-headless-shop`) is a headless storefront for the RAD brand. Webflow is the CMS and design source; this codebase is the headless frontend/commerce layer.

## Webflow MCP usage

Do not call Webflow MCP for content or inventory; use this rule for structure. Call MCP only when the user says Webflow structure changed — then re-fetch schema/pages/collections and update this rule.

Live product data, prices, sold-out state, and CMS item content belong in the Webflow Data API at runtime (or app cache), not in chat via MCP.

